      "text": "PK id                    SERIAL\n   name                  VARCHAR(255)\n   campaign_type         PAGE|PROFILE|POST\n   actions               'FOLLOW' |\n                         'REACT,COMMENT,SHARE'\n   reactions             'LIKE,LOVE,HAHA,...'\n   account_count         INT\n   delay_seconds_min/max INT (30 / 60)\n   status                PENDING|RUNNING|STOPPING\n                         |STOPPED|COMPLETED|FAILED\n   total_planned  -+\n   total_success   | bộ đếm cho trang Lịch sử\n   total_failed   -+\n   created_by            -> users.id (logic)\n   started_at / finished_at\n   created_at / updated_at",
