      "text": "PK id                  SERIAL\nFK campaign_id         -> seeding_campaigns\nFK campaign_target_id  -> seeding_campaign_targets\nFK target_id           -> seeding_targets\n   account_uid         -> accounts.uid (logic)\n   action              FOLLOW|REACT\n                       |COMMENT|SHARE\n   reaction            LIKE|LOVE|CARE|HAHA|WOW|...\nFK comment_id          -> seeding_comments\n   status              PENDING|RUNNING|SUCCESS\n                       |FAILED|SKIPPED\n   attempts            INT\n   error_message       TEXT\n   scheduled_at        thời điểm sớm nhất (giãn cách)\n   started_at / finished_at / created_at\n\nIX (status, scheduled_at)        hàng đợi\nIX (campaign_id, status)         tiến trình\nIX (account_uid, finished_at)    đếm theo ngày\nUQ (account_uid, target_id, action)\n   WHERE status IN (PENDING, RUNNING, SUCCESS)",
      "fontSize": 15,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": "rectangle-27-a0a8a4",
      "originalText": "PK id                  SERIAL\nFK campaign_id         -> seeding_campaigns\nFK campaign_target_id  -> seeding_campaign_targets\nFK target_id           -> seeding_targets\n   account_uid         -> accounts.uid (logic)\n   action              FOLLOW|REACT\n                       |COMMENT|SHARE\n   reaction            LIKE|LOVE|CARE|HAHA|WOW|...\nFK comment_id          -> seeding_comments\n   status              PENDING|RUNNING|SUCCESS\n                       |FAILED|SKIPPED\n   attempts            INT\n   error_message       TEXT\n   scheduled_at        thời điểm sớm nhất (giãn cách)\n   started_at / finished_at / created_at\n\nIX (status, scheduled_at)        hàng đợi\nIX (campaign_id, status)         tiến trình\nIX (account_uid, finished_at)    đếm theo ngày\nUQ (account_uid, target_id, action)\n   WHERE status IN (PENDING, RUNNING, SUCCESS)",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "index": "aS"
    },
